OL,5,G2206 The Climate Question
OL,6,     FThe UN says we will pass our most
OL,7,     Fimportant climate target in the
OL,8,     Fnext few years. Is it possible to
OL,9,     Fbring the global temperature back
OL,10,     Fdown? And will the damage be
OL,11,     Firreversible?
