OL,15,G2232 Assignment
OL,16,     FWhy has anti-Ukrainian feeling
OL,17,     Fbeen growing in Poland? From
OL,18,     Fwelcoming them with open arms four
OL,19,     Fyears ago, now many Poles want
OL,20,     FUkrainians to go home.
